<title>USA: U.S. business loans fell $3.5 bln in July 9 week.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans fell $3.5 bln in July 9 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks fell $3.5 billion to $818.7 billion in the week ended July 9, the Federal Reserve said on Friday.</p>
</text>
